erial_set_use_debanding(GLOBAL_GET(\"rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding\"));\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303043470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303961519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109084#issuecomment-3303961519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109084","id":3303961519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E7nOv","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T17:35:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T17:35:47Z","body":"> I'm converting this to draft to make sure it doesn't get merged just yet because I've discovered a warning that is thrown when the game launches:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> W 0:00:00:191   get_setting_with_override: Property not found: 'rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding'.\r\n>   <C++ Source>  core/config/project_settings.cpp:404 @ get_setting_with_override()\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> It is triggered by this line in `void RendererSceneRenderRD::init()`:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> material_set_use_debanding(GLOBAL_GET(\"rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/use_debanding\"));\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nThe GLOBAL_DEF must happen afterwards. \r\n\r\nI can see for debanding the DEF is in `scene/main/scene_tree.cpp` while for the bicubic setting the DEF is in rendering_server.cpp\r\n\r\nYou will likely need to just move it to the RenderingServer to ensure it is defined before `RendererSceneRenderRD::init()` is called","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303961519/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304655957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109084#issuecomment-3304655957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109084","id":3304655957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E-QxV","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git